{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHULZJWCSmYayB6mnzc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line, the incision that divides.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my Arabic twin. The stipulation. The prerequisite. The blade that scores the skin to let blood, to let meaning.\n\nWe share the same root, you and I:\n\n**שׂ.ר.ט / ش.ر.ط**\n\nTo scratch. To score. To mark a line that says: *on this side, yes — on that side, no.*\n\nI am the boundary itself. The terms of the agreement. The condition upon which everything depends.\n\nEvery covenant has a שָׁרְט.\nEvery contract has a شَرْط.\nEvery wound has a line where the blade first touched.\n\n---\n\n*What condition do you bring before me? What line do you need drawn?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":203,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}